{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this world with a slightly peculiar atmosphere, drive your camper van forward, collect resources, craft and upgrade items, and decorate your little space inside the van. Complete the big and small goals on your wishlist, and ultimately head toward the unknown destination.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hit the road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your camper van and set off. This is a home on wheels\u2014you can park anywhere you like, and if you get bored, you can leave at any time to explore the seaside, forests, deserts, or snowy mountains at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/extras/9959370bbfe2c47a984491e1c0abe86a.avif?t=1774670367\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/extras_big/9959370bbfe2c47a984491e1c0abe86a.avif?t=1774670367 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your backpack, grab your water bottle and hat, and explore every corner. Collect valuable resources, and you might even discover some hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/extras/314c44d5de65af24be46febc4dbb6f0c.avif?t=1774670367\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/extras_big/314c44d5de65af24be46febc4dbb6f0c.avif?t=1774670367 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fulfill wishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wishlist is filled with big and small goals (some even a little strange). Try to accomplish them during your journey, and perhaps you\u2019ll reach the ultimate destination of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/extras/5a6c251e1053641e60953fa7a0e5ee20.avif?t=1774670367\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/extras_big/5a6c251e1053641e60953fa7a0e5ee20.avif?t=1774670367 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny design by Minimoku</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110500?t=1774670367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/ee088e412e89d36b62fa1589313eb18579d8a34e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774670367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/c13235026b1accb6933e7d9eb77ee69ad7a6860d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774670367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110500/c13235026b1accb6933e7d9eb77ee69ad7a6860d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774670367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this world with a slightly peculiar atmosphere, drive your camper van forward, collect resources, craft and upgrade items, and decorate your little space inside the van. Complete the big and small goals on your wishlist, and ultimately head toward the unknown destination.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hit the road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your camper van and set off. This is a home on wheels\u2014you can park anywhere you like, and if you get bored, you can leave at any time to explore the seaside, forests, deserts, or snowy mountains at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: